## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design an online, nonstationary ICA workflow for streaming, real-time financial data, with emphasis on time–frequency handling, permutation alignment, and practical evaluation.

## Key Concepts

- Online convolutional ICA for nonstationary signals
- Time–frequency domain demixing and permutation tracking
- EMA-based whitening with forgetting factors to adapt to regime changes
- Real-time latency targets and economically meaningful evaluation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code sketch for online ICA (conceptual)
function onlineICA(X, state){
  const Ww = whiteningEMA(X, state.window); // rolling whitening
  let W = initializeDemixing(state);
  for (let b of freqBins){
    W[b] = onlineJointDiagonalization(W[b], X[b], state.forget);
  }
  const S = matMul(W, X);
  return {S, W};
}
```

